    "What we ordered: • Ube Wan Chai Nobe Latte (w/ oat milk) • Banana Crème Matcha Brûlée (w/ oat milk) …",
    "This place has the best coffee in the Sugar Land/Missouri city area. And I have tried them all - both locally owned and chains. Why are people waiting in line at the Crap-bucks next door? It’s literally 20 feet away? Bean Here has a drive through if you’re in a hurry. Even better, you get a nice big mug “for here” orders.",
    "Support a local buisness!! This place is superb! Got an iced coffee for the first time here and it's way better than any Starbucks. Plus the staff are friendly and gave me a lot of recommendations. I'll be returning to try more of their drink recs very soon! They also have pastries and breakfast tacos. 🤤 …"
